#: src/Privacy/Integration.php:42
msgid "<p>When enabled by this site, PixelPair sends browsing and purchase events to Meta, TikTok, Google Analytics or Google Tag Manager according to the configured consent categories. Events may contain page details, product identifiers, totals, IP address, user agent and advertising cookie/click identifiers. Optional advanced matching sends normalized SHA-256 hashes of permitted contact identifiers. These hashes remain personal data.</p><p>PixelPair may store campaign attribution on orders and an encrypted matching/consent snapshot for up to 30 days of eligible dispatch. Delivery jobs are encrypted and are cleared on completion or purged after seven days; redacted logs follow the owner-selected 1–90 day retention. Order attribution persists until erased with WordPress privacy tools or removed by the owner. Explain your enabled destinations, legal basis, retention, international transfers and how visitors can change consent.</p>"
msgstr ""

